  Used by TerminalActivity's top bar, which is built with the View system rather than Compose, so it
  cannot reach Icons.AutoMirrored.Filled.ArrowBack. Drawing it as a resource keeps the terminal's
  back control identical to the one in the Compose screens.
-->
